#!golden 1
#!case cmd_lan_help
#!section exit
0
#!section stdout
#!section stderr
LAN Commands:
\t\t   print [<channel number>]
\t\t   set <channel number> <command> <parameter>
\t\t   alert print <channel number> <alert destination>
\t\t   alert set <channel number> <alert destination> <command> <parameter>
\t\t   stats get [<channel number>]
\t\t   stats clear [<channel number>]
#!section requests
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=00
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=03
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
bye
